  "fullDescription": "Relaxing Christmas Coloring Book – Peaceful Holiday Scenes, Festive Mandalas & Cozy Winter Art for Adults. Celebrate the season of joy with the Relaxing Christmas Coloring Book, a beautiful collection of holiday coloring pages for adults designed to bring calm, peace, and creativity. Featuring festive mandalas, Christmas tree illustrations, snowflake patterns, and cozy winter scenes, this stress relief coloring book is perfect for unwinding during the holidays.\n\nTHIS INTERIOR DOWNLOAD DETAILS:\n🦋 96 Christmas COLORING PAGES.\n🦋 NO REPEATED IMAGES.\n🦋 JPG | PNG | PDF.\n🦋 96 JPG FILE (PRINT READY).\n🦋 96 PNG FILE (PRINT READY).\n🦋 01 PDF FILE (PRINT READY).\n🦋 19 BOOK COVER IMAGES.\n🦋 SINGLE-SIDED PAGES.\n🦋 SIZE 8.5″ X 8.5″ INCH.\n🦋 SINGLE-SIDED PAGES.\n🦋 ALL IMAGES ARE VERY GOOD.\n🦋 HIGH-QUALITY 300 DPI IMAGES FILE.\n\nEach page is filled with detailed Christmas designs, including ornaments, stockings, reindeer, Santa, and holiday wreaths, making this the ideal adult Christmas coloring book for relaxation and creativity. Whether you love winter wonderland illustrations, holiday mandala art, or Christmas-themed patterns, this collection offers hours of stress-free fun.\n\nBook Cover Details:\n🪶 19 PNG file ( 300 dpi ).\n🪶 You can resize when you design.\n\nPerfect for coloring with gel pens, markers, or colored pencils, this festive holiday coloring book makes a wonderful gift or personal escape into the magic of the season. Bring the spirit of Christmas to life with every page, and enjoy a peaceful holiday experience through art.",
